   "cooked": "<p>The Hatch Outreach working group is responsible for reaching out to backers (Hatchers) and helping guide projects to submit proposals for funding. Find us on the <span class=\"hashtag\">#hatch-outreach</span> channel on our Discord.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Meetings: Wednesdays at 6pm CET</li>\n<li>Where? <a href=\"https://discord.gg/E2sJXDBcnr\">Hatch Outreach Voice Channel on Discord</a>\n</li>\n<li>WG Lead: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/vegayp\">@vegayp</a> and <a href=\"https://t.me/Tam2140\">@Tam2140</a>\n</li>\n<li>Discussions happen on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8hR8rrhgFG\">Hatch Outreach channel</a>; join us!</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P3Zp8VxVra1usaIwcf_p8F4berw_EezGkYQALmTz3Ng/edit#heading=h.yxpwzx470gkv\">Hatcher Outreach Manifesto: Updated on the 10th of March</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1DsaTuJ6s9CXfe-YT6Y0KmtKbAKHv6jPLEBdPKxNUSZs/edit\">Weekly Agenda Notes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TECommons/coordination/projects/7\">Github coordination</a></li>\n<li>TEC Curate: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1RJK8gPqUoRfehX9e60sTCMAM_R1rI2CuiV1r-i3wAXQ/edit#gid=875503092\">Document that serves as a reference for keeping track of hatchers and potential proposals</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>Initial documents that served as a reference for this working group creation:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O7DsKdhU9TmW36lXH_pRNeUiawglry-_4BWFx2nKttE/edit\">Onboarding working document - last updated Oct 17</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://miro.com/app/board/o9J_kiNo1dQ=/\">Stakeholder and ecosystem mapping </a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jGJlLisb3ZcFz-4amkgjjnh5GobLJnGeHNZx7gqK8Zo/edit#heading=h.3tjyz79z4wn9\">Crypto economics working doc</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k9sAlf2XitY\">TE Academy presentation of the onboarding research </a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1L2fbTEs6kBkwQhKLI9guUBu1hnXCAH6uTCTtaeJynLQ/edit#heading=h.4qr126s3qfr1\">Interviews initial working document </a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZawaNfDdkcsYleZMFqqCpVWHc5UhlLllIlsgfAGrJPQ/edit#heading=h.s1r0u34np0eh\">List of questions for interviews </a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://ehanover21.typeform.com/to/z358PCBi\">Stakeholder interview in typeform </a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1-_fq-iYb22loBuj1iExNYtv0x2EKY36gz-lg1mMDboc/edit#gid=501943413\">8 typeform </a>responses</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16iXxRMzV4jqQNK0gZE5pXnHRV3AkJfNb\">Interviews folder </a></li>\n</ul>",
